---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms of Service - Banners All Over" description="Terms of Service for Banners All Over Shopify app">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="mb-12">
      <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL} class="nav-link inline-flex items-center text-bao-blue hover:text-bao-blue-600 transition-colors mb-6">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 19l-7-7m0 0l7-7m-7 7h18"/>
        </svg>
        Back to Home
      </a>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-600">Last Updated: December 2, 2025</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="legal-content prose prose-lg max-w-none">

      <!-- Introduction -->
      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">1. Introduction and Acceptance</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          Welcome to Banners All Over ("we," "us," "our," or "BAO"). These Terms of Service ("Terms") govern your access to and use of the Banners All Over application (the "App" or "Service"), a Shopify application that enables merchants to create, manage, and display banners on their Shopify stores.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          By installing, accessing, or using the Banners All Over app, you ("you," "your," or "Merchant") agree to be bound by these Terms. If you do not agree to these Terms, you may not use our Service.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          These Terms constitute a legally binding agreement between you and Banners All Over. Please read them carefully.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Eligibility and Account -->
      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">2. Eligibility and Account Requirements</h2>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">2.1 Eligibility</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          To use Banners All Over, you must:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-4 space-y-2">
          <li>Be at least 18 years of age or the age of majority in your jurisdiction</li>
          <li>Operate a legitimate Shopify store in good standing</li>
          <li>Have the legal authority to enter into these Terms on behalf of your business</li>
          <li>Comply with all applicable local, state, national, and international laws and regulations</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">2.2 Account Creation</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          Your Banners All Over account is created and authenticated through the Shopify App Store. By installing our App, you authorize us to access certain information from your Shopify store as necessary to provide the Service. You are responsible for maintaining the security of your Shopify account credentials.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">2.3 Account Responsibilities</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          You are solely responsible for all activities that occur under your account. You agree to immediately notify us of any unauthorized use of your account or any other security breach.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Service Description -->
      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">3. Service Description and Limitations</h2>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">3.1 Service Overview</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          Banners All Over provides tools to create, customize, and display banners on your Shopify store. Features include but are not limited to:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-4 space-y-2">
          <li>Multiple banner types (Image, Image & Text, Video, Product)</li>
          <li>Banner placement controls across various pages</li>
          <li>Display rules and scheduling</li>
          <li>Responsive design for desktop, tablet, and mobile devices</li>
          <li>Customization options for themes, colors, fonts, and animations</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">3.2 Subscription Tiers</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-2">
          Banners All Over is offered through four subscription tiers:
        </p>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 pt-1 pr-1 pb-1 pl-4 rounded-lg mb-2">
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700">
            <li><strong>Basic Plan (Free):</strong> 2 banners, 2 slides each, Image & Image+Text types, Homepage placement only</li>
            <li><strong>Standard Plan:</strong> 10 banners, 5 slides each, additional placement options and features</li>
            <li><strong>Pro Plan:</strong> 30 banners, 10 slides each, Video & Product types, advanced features</li>
            <li><strong>Business Plan:</strong> Unlimited banners and slides, all page placements, priority support</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          Each tier includes specific limitations on the number of banners, slides, banner types, and placement options. For current pricing details, including monthly and annual billing options, please visit:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-4 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Pricing Page:</strong> <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/#pricing`} class="text-bao-blue hover:underline">View Pricing Plans</a></li>
          <li><strong>Shopify App Store:</strong> <a href="https://apps.shopify.com/banners-all-over" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-bao-blue hover:underline">Banners All Over Listing</a></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          <strong>Note:</strong> All paid plans are billed in <strong>USD (United States Dollars)</strong>. Annual billing provides approximately <strong>20% savings</strong> compared to monthly billing.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">3.3 Service Availability</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          We strive to provide reliable service, but we do not guarantee that the Service will be uninterrupted, error-free, or completely secure. Service availability may be affected by factors including but not limited to maintenance, updates, or circumstances beyond our control.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Payment Terms -->
      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">4. Payment Terms and Billing</h2>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">4.1 Billing Through Shopify</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          All payments for Banners All Over subscriptions are processed through Shopify's billing system. By subscribing to a paid plan, you authorize Shopify to charge the applicable fees to your Shopify account.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">4.2 Subscription Renewals</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          Subscriptions automatically renew at the end of each billing period (monthly or annually) unless you cancel before the renewal date. You will be charged the then-current rate for your selected plan tier.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">4.3 Price Changes</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          We reserve the right to modify our pricing at any time. Price changes will take effect at the start of your next billing cycle. We will provide at least 30 days' advance notice of any price increases. Your continued use of the Service after a price change constitutes acceptance of the new pricing.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">4.4 Taxes</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          All fees are exclusive of applicable taxes, levies, or duties. You are responsible for paying all such taxes associated with your subscription, except for taxes based on our net income.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">4.5 Refunds and Cancellations</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          Please refer to our <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}legal/refunds`} class="text-bao-blue hover:underline">Subscriptions and Refunds Policy</a> for detailed information about cancellations, refunds, and related procedures.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- User Responsibilities -->
      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">5. User Responsibilities and Acceptable Use</h2>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">5.1 Content Responsibility</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
