        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          You agree not to use Banners All Over to create, upload, or display content that:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-4 space-y-2">
          <li>Is illegal, fraudulent, defamatory, obscene, pornographic, or otherwise objectionable</li>
          <li>Promotes violence, discrimination, or hatred against individuals or groups</li>
          <li>Contains malware, viruses, or other harmful code</li>
          <li>Violates any intellectual property rights, including copyrights, trademarks, or patents</li>
          <li>Contains false, misleading, or deceptive advertising claims</li>
          <li>Violates consumer protection laws or advertising regulations</li>
          <li>Infringes on privacy rights or discloses confidential information without authorization</li>
          <li>Impersonates any person or entity or misrepresents your affiliation with any person or entity</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">5.3 System Integrity</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          You agree not to:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-4 space-y-2">
          <li>Attempt to gain unauthorized access to our systems or networks</li>
          <li>Interfere with or disrupt the Service or servers or networks connected to the Service</li>
          <li>Use automated systems or software to extract data from the Service ("scraping")</li>
          <li>Reverse engineer, decompile, or disassemble any portion of the Service</li>
          <li>Remove or modify any proprietary notices or labels on the Service</li>
          <li>Use the Service in any manner that could damage, disable, overburden, or impair our servers</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">5.4 Compliance with Laws</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          You agree to comply with all applicable local, state, national, and international laws and regulations in connection with your use of the Service, including but not limited to advertising laws, consumer protection laws, and data protection regulations.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Intellectual Property -->
      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">6. Intellectual Property Rights</h2>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">6.1 BAO's Intellectual Property</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
