        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-4 space-y-2">
          <li>Resell or commercially exploit the Service</li>
          <li>Modify, copy, or create derivative works of the Service</li>
          <li>Distribute, transmit, or make the Service available to third parties</li>
          <li>Use the Service for the benefit of any third party</li>
