          <li>Displaying banners on your Shopify store as configured by you</li>
          <li>Processing and storing your banner configurations</li>
          <li>Improving and developing the Service (using aggregated, anonymized data)</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          This license terminates when you delete your User Content or close your account, except where we need to retain it for legal, security, or backup purposes as described in our <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/legal/privacy`} class="text-bao-blue hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a>.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">6.3 DMCA and Copyright Infringement</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          The <strong>Digital Millennium Copyright Act (DMCA)</strong> is a United States copyright law that provides a process for copyright holders to request the removal of content that infringes their rights.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          We respect intellectual property rights and expect our users to do the same. If you believe that your copyrighted work has been copied in a way that constitutes copyright infringement through our Service, please contact us with the following information:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-4 space-y-2">
          <li>A description of the copyrighted work you claim has been infringed</li>
          <li>A description of where the allegedly infringing material is located</li>
          <li>Your contact information (address, telephone number, email)</li>
          <li>A statement that you have a good faith belief that the disputed use is not authorized</li>
          <li>A statement, under penalty of perjury, that the information is accurate and that you are authorized to act on behalf of the copyright owner</li>
          <li>Your physical or electronic signature</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          Please send DMCA notices to our legal team. For contact details, see <a href="#contact-information" class="text-bao-blue hover:underline font-semibold">Section 16</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- AI Features -->
      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">7. AI-Powered Features (Future)</h2>

        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          We may introduce AI-powered features in the future, including but not limited to AI image generation, image enhancement, and text optimization. When these features become available, the following terms will apply:
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">7.1 AI-Generated Content</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          You understand and agree that:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-4 space-y-2">
          <li>AI-generated content is produced by algorithms and may not always be accurate, appropriate, or error-free</li>
          <li>You are solely responsible for reviewing and approving all AI-generated content before using it in your banners</li>
          <li>We make no warranties regarding the quality, accuracy, or suitability of AI-generated content</li>
          <li>You bear full responsibility for ensuring AI-generated content complies with all applicable laws and does not infringe third-party rights</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">7.2 AI Training and Data Usage</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          When AI features are implemented, we will provide clear disclosure about:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-4 space-y-2">
          <li>Whether your content will be used to train AI models</li>
          <li>What third-party AI service providers we use</li>
          <li>Your options to opt out of AI training (if available)</li>
          <li>How AI-generated content rights are handled</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">7.3 No Guarantee of Results</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          AI features are provided as experimental tools to assist you. We do not guarantee that AI features will produce specific results, improve your business outcomes, or meet your expectations. Use of AI features is at your own risk.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Privacy and Data -->
      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">8. Privacy and Data Protection</h2>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">8.1 Privacy Policy</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          Our collection, use, and protection of your personal information is governed by our <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}legal/privacy`} class="text-bao-blue hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a>, which is incorporated into these Terms by reference. Please review our <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}legal/privacy`} class="text-bao-blue hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a> to understand our data practices.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">8.2 Shopify Data Access</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          By installing Banners All Over, you authorize us to access certain data from your Shopify store as necessary to provide the Service. This may include store information, product catalog data, and other information required for banner functionality.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">8.3 Data Security</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          We implement reasonable security measures to protect your data. However, no system is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security of your information.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">8.4 Data Retention and Deletion</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          Upon termination of your account, we will retain your data for 30 days before permanently deleting it, unless we are required to retain it longer for legal, regulatory, or backup purposes. The data that will be permanently deleted includes:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-4 space-y-2">
          <li>All banners and banner configurations you created</li>
          <li>Uploaded images and media files</li>
          <li>Text content, headlines, and copy added to banners</li>
          <li>All creative content included in or generated through the app</li>
          <li>Banner settings, display rules, and scheduling configurations</li>
          <li>Customization preferences (themes, colors, fonts, animations)</li>
          <li>Any other user-generated content stored within the Service</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          The data deletion is permanent and cannot be reversed. You may request deletion of your data at any time as described in our Privacy Policy. 
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Service Modifications -->
      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">9. Service Modifications and Termination</h2>

