          <li>Excessive or abusive use that disrupts the Service</li>
          <li>Upon your request</li>
          <li>Discontinuation of the Service</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">9.5 Effect of Termination</h3>
