        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          WE ARE NOT LIABLE FOR:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-4 space-y-2">
          <li>Any loss or damage caused by your User Content or how you use the Service</li>
          <li>Changes to Shopify's platform that affect the Service's functionality</li>
          <li>Third-party actions or inactions, including Shopify</li>
          <li>Your failure to backup your data</li>
